...Most Time Spent on the Floor Award!

817
00:48:41,379 --> 00:48:44,379
Oh, that I believe! Yay!

818
00:48:44,379 --> 00:48:48,512
Thank you! Thank you! I know you guys probably think I would never get this award...

819
00:48:48,512 --> 00:48:51,779
...but you know, I worked so hard to stay on the floor.

820
00:48:51,779 --> 00:48:54,179
Very unprecedented.

821
00:48:54,179 --> 00:48:58,512
And yeah, not only did I stay on the floor, I, you know, really did my best to...

822
00:48:58,512 --> 00:49:04,179
...practice dancing and singing this year to perform well with you guys!

823
00:49:04,179 --> 00:49:08,179
And I hope that you guys see that as well! Thank you so much for all your support!

824
00:49:08,179 --> 00:49:11,612
I'll continue to do my best with these girls!

825
00:49:11,612 --> 00:49:15,712
Yeah! Myth! Let's keep doing it! Thank you Myth!

826
00:49:15,712 --> 00:49:18,279
And last, but not least... me!

827
00:49:18,279 --> 00:49:22,179
Oh, what could it be? Could it be our sneezer?

828
00:49:22,179 --> 00:49:25,312
The serial sneezer!

829
00:49:25,312 --> 00:49:29,845
Most sneezes in the Myth 5th Anniversary Showcase!

830
00:49:29,845 --> 00:49:33,179
Well, actually, my trophy is for... ta-da!

831
00:49:33,479 --> 00:49:38,379
Best Worst Luck Award! Especially in games where there are microtransactions!

832
00:49:38,379 --> 00:49:42,679
Oh no! That's not so positive!

833
00:49:42,679 --> 00:49:46,212
I mean, I've seen it happen in real life! Real time!

834
00:49:46,212 --> 00:49:50,179
With the dedication, the determination to pull a signed card or not! I'm not gonna give up yet!

835
00:49:50,179 --> 00:49:53,479
Real quick, I'm gonna be very sappy...

836
00:49:53,479 --> 00:49:56,179
Yeah, okay, go ahead!

837
00:49:56,179 --> 00:50:00,179
I really like that line, "I'm not..."

838
00:50:00,234 --> 00:50:02,034
...give up yet, because... because...

839
00:50:02,034 --> 00:50:05,934
I'd like to think that we're not gonna give up yet,

840
00:50:05,934 --> 00:50:09,634
because there's still so much that I want to do,

841
00:50:09,634 --> 00:50:11,934
the three of us together,

842
00:50:11,934 --> 00:50:13,834
together, you know?

843
00:50:13,834 --> 00:50:18,234
Um, and I didn't think that I would be here five years from the start with you guys.

844
00:50:18,234 --> 00:50:19,234
Same.

845
00:50:19,234 --> 00:50:21,034
Yeah, I really thought I'd be out of here.

846
00:50:21,034 --> 00:50:22,034
Same!

847
00:50:22,034 --> 00:50:27,734
Um, but now, I can't... I can't see a future where I'm not here with you guys, so for now...

848
00:50:27,734 --> 00:50:30,034
Aww, that's so sweet!

849
00:50:30,034 --> 00:50:32,234
Callie, shush. Okay.

850
00:50:32,234 --> 00:50:38,434
So because of that, I'm not gonna give up yet. I don't want to give up yet. So let's do our best together.

851
00:50:38,834 --> 00:50:42,734
Oh yeah, the wrapping music, the jingle is playing!

852
00:50:42,734 --> 00:50:46,734
I'm just gonna start talking about nothing because that annoys me when they play the jingle to tell me to shut up.

853
00:50:46,734 --> 00:50:48,234
Callie, you're a rapper! Rap! Rap!

854
00:50:48,234 --> 00:50:52,234
This morning I ate a bagel and it had cream cheese on it and it was delicious, but it went over my...

855
00:50:52,234 --> 00:50:53,734
Oh my god, you're so mean!

856
00:50:53,734 --> 00:50:55,434
I had a big struggle with my trailer...

857
00:50:55,434 --> 00:50:56,734
Okay, okay, it's fine.

858
00:50:56,734 --> 00:50:58,434
Anyway, you can't get rid of me!

859
00:50:58,434 --> 00:51:00,234
You can't get rid of...

860
00:51:00,234 --> 00:51:02,034
...any of us, hopefully!

861
00:51:02,234 --> 00:51:06,234
Well everybody, all good things come to an end, unfortunately,

862
00:51:06,234 --> 00:51:10,734
but thank you so much to the hololive English community for supporting us continuously for 5 years.

863
00:51:10,734 --> 00:51:17,034
Thank you to the girls today and all the staff-san that supported us also for the celebration who gave us the trophies.

864
00:51:17,034 --> 00:51:20,034
Yeah, once again, congratulations to us!

865
00:51:20,034 --> 00:51:23,234
Yay! To five years! To hololive English!

866
00:51:23,234 --> 00:51:25,734
Thank you! Bye-bye!

867
00:51:25,734 --> 00:51:28,234
Bye-bye! Bye-bye!

868
00:51:28,234 --> 00:51:30,034
Peace!

869
00:51:30,034 --> 00:51:31,234
Wait, we forgot the merch!

870
00:51:31,234 --> 00:51:32,434
The merch!

871
00:51:32,434 --> 00:51:34,434
Merch! Merch, please!

872
00:51:34,434 --> 00:51:37,234
Merchandise!

873
00:51:40,234 --> 00:51:43,734
Next up is the merchandise announcement!

874
00:51:43,734 --> 00:51:50,034
We have hololive English -Myth- 5th Anniversary Celebration merch being released!

875
00:51:50,234 --> 00:51:53,234
Let's look at the details. Check it out!

876
00:51:53,234 --> 00:51:56,734
First up, we've got the Mirror Acrylic Panel.

877
00:51:56,734 --> 00:52:01,734
It's designed so that the surroundings and background of the illustration have a metallic mirrored vibe.

878
00:52:01,734 --> 00:52:06,234
So cool! I absolutely love this illustration. Hope you guys do too.

879
00:52:06,234 --> 00:52:10,734
Next up, we have the Collection Cards!

880
00:52:10,734 --> 00:52:17,734
These cards feature a shiny metallic finish, and you can choose from three different designs.

881
00:52:17,734 --> 00:52:21,234
Also, the back side is matching for us all.

882
00:52:21,234 --> 00:52:24,734
Make sure to get the one from your oshi for sure!

883
00:52:24,734 --> 00:52:28,234
Next up, we have the Coin Medals!

884
00:52:28,234 --> 00:52:33,734
Our shiny 5th anniversary commemorative coin medals, there's one design for each member.

885
00:52:33,734 --> 00:52:37,234
And the back side also has a common design.

886
00:52:37,234 --> 00:52:44,734
They come in an antique gold-plated finish inside the original packaging. Ooh, so shiny!

887
00:52:44,734 --> 00:52:51,734
Oh man, everything looks so good, but I'm especially interested in what we have to show you guys next.

888
00:52:51,734 --> 00:52:55,734
Next up, we have the Anniversary Hats!

889
00:52:55,734 --> 00:52:59,234
So first up, Anniversary Hat - Mori Calliope!

890
00:52:59,234 --> 00:53:03,234
This one uses a soft, fluffy fabric.

891
00:53:03,234 --> 00:53:07,734
The Death Sensei part is removable, so you can also rock it without him.

892
00:53:07,734 --> 00:53:10,734
Make sure that you check it out. It's super stylish! I love the shape so much, and...

893
00:53:10,734 --> 00:53:14,734
...all of my members Dead Beats voted on it together, so hope that you guys will enjoy.

894
00:53:14,734 --> 00:53:20,734
Next up, we have mine! The Anniversary Hat from Takanashi Kiara looks like this!

895
00:53:20,734 --> 00:53:25,234
Decorative parts are removable. It can be worn reversibly, inside out,

896
00:53:25,234 --> 00:53:29,734
